  "category": "instrumentation",
  "description": "Converts 4-20 mA DCS current loop signal to calibrated engineering process measurement.",
  "mathematical_expression": "Process_Val = Range_Min + ((Current_mA - 4.0) / 16.0) * (Range_Max - Range_Min)",
